<title>USA: Dayton Superior sees Ironco adding to net.</title>
<headline>Dayton Superior sees Ironco adding to net.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMISBURG, Ohio 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dayton Superior Corp said on Monday it expects its acquisition of Ironco Manufacturing Co and Birmingham Bar Coating of Birmingham, Ala., to add to 1997's profits.</p>
<p>These two related companies manufacture and distribute paving products used in highway construction, Dayton said.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed, Dayton Superior said.</p>
<p>Ironco and Birmingham Bar's respective financial results were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
